ng its namesake historic district.","evidence_claim":"The City of Lakeland lists Munn Park at 201 East Main Street among its downtown outdoor venues.","source_url":"https://www.lakelandgov.net/departments/parks-recreation-and-cultural-arts/reservations-rentals/","source_title":"Reservations & Rentals | City of Lakeland","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"201 East Main Street. Public access can be affected by permitted events; consult city notices before visiting.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"black-and-brew-east-main-street","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Black & Brew Coffee House & Bistro","title":"Stop at the Original Café","subtitle":"East Main Street — downtown coffeehouse","notes":"Follow East Main Street to the flagship café facing Munn Park; review the current menu before deciding whether to order food or coffee.","short_summary":"Black & Brew’s original location occupies a documented downtown address.","evidence_claim":"Black & Brew identifies 205 East Main Street as its flagship store, opened in February 2006 in downtown Lakeland.","source_url":"https://blackandbrew.com/our-story/","source_title":"Our Story - Black & Brew Coffee House and Bistro","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"205 East Main Street. A purchase is required to consume menu items; consult the business for current hours.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"concord-coffee-south-florida-avenue","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Concord Coffee","title":"Take a South Florida Avenue Coffee Break","subtitle":"South Florida Avenue — Dixieland café","notes":"Walk west to South Florida Avenue and look behind the Dixieland plaza for the posted parking area;